{"op": "append", "content": "[\u26a0\ufe0f] [2026-01-05 02:13:44 UTC] [Agent: Orchestrator] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] CRITICAL SCOPE CORRECTION: Phase 1 rescoped per directive. Original plan had 4 agents covering 28 tools (optimistic grouping). New rule: Monster files (>1,000 LOC) get solo agents. NO agent may audit >1 ultra-high/high-complexity tool. Depth over throughput. Audit quality prioritized over speed. | action=scope_correction; directive_source=human; new_agent_count_min=11; old_agent_count=4; phase=1_tool_audit; priority_shift=depth_over_throughput; reason=monster_files_are_systems; rule=one_agent_per_monster_tool; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-05T02:13:44.129171+00:00_fb7fab45", "timestamp": "2026-01-05T02:13:44.129247+00:00"}
