{"op": "append", "content": "[\u26a0\ufe0f] [2026-01-05 02:23:24 UTC] [Agent: Orchestrator] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] DEPLOYMENT STRATEGY CORRECTION: Switching from concurrent 12-agent launch to 3-wave staggered deployment with quality gates. Wave 1: 5 monster tools. Wave 2: 4 medium tools (after Wave 1 gates met). Wave 3: 3 batched utilities (after Wave 2 gates met). Prevents context melt and ensures audit fidelity over speed. | action=deployment_strategy_correction; new_strategy=3_wave_gated_deployment; old_strategy=12_concurrent_agents; phase=1_tool_audit; rationale=prevent_context_melt_and_half_finished_deliverables; wave_1_agents=5; wave_2_agents=4; wave_3_agents=3; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-05T02:23:24.058572+00:00_a356a3a3", "timestamp": "2026-01-05T02:23:24.058607+00:00"}
