{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-05 02:35:17 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-C-QueryEntries] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] Complete sub-system mapping of query_entries.py finished. Identified 9 distinct architectural layers: (1) Parameter Validation/Healing (lines 61-407, 25 params, triple-tier recovery), (2) Search Query Building (406-584, config object dance), (3) Search Execution Orchestrator (586-994, calls search strategy), (4) Main Entry Point (995-1270, emergency handling), (5) Cross-Project Resolution (1271-1374, scope routing), (6) Document Type Strategies (1376-1728, 4 search variants), (7) Document Parsing (1729-1879, research/markdown/entry creation), (8) Code Reference Verification (1880-1938, optional feature), (9) Relevance Scoring (1939-2009, threshold filtering). Total: 24 functions across 2,030 LOC. | lines_per_subsystem={\"code_verification\": \"1880-1938\", \"document_parsing\": \"1729-1879\", \"document_strategies\": \"1376-1728\", \"execution_orchestrator\": \"586-994\", \"main_entry\": \"995-1270\", \"parameter_validation\": \"61-407\", \"project_resolution\": \"1271-1374\", \"query_building\": \"406-584\", \"relevance_scoring\": \"1939-2009\"}; phase=sub_system_mapping; reasoning={\"how\": \"Mapped all 24 functions to architectural layers, identified line ranges, documented responsibilities per layer\", \"what\": \"Identified 9 distinct layers with clear responsibilities. Constraint: Layers should be independent. Observation: Multiple layers handle error recovery independently (validation, query building, execution, main). Pattern suggests error handling is cross-cutting concern.\", \"why\": \"Need complete architectural map before identifying extractable modules and cross-cutting concerns\"}; sub_systems=[\"parameter_validation_healing\", \"search_query_building\", \"search_execution_orchestrator\", \"main_entry_point\", \"cross_project_resolution\", \"document_type_strategies\", \"document_parsing\", \"code_reference_verification\", \"relevance_scoring\"]; sub_systems_identified=9; total_functions=24; total_lines=2030; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-05T02:35:17.694999+00:00_a0447087", "timestamp": "2026-01-05T02:35:17.695033+00:00"}
