entries complete - documented architecture for Phase 6 refactoring without requiring re-reading source\"}; sub_systems=9; token_samples=7; tool_audited=query_entries.py; total_logs=11; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-05T02:48:24.553233+00:00_612c271a", "timestamp": "2026-01-05T02:48:24.553269+00:00"}
