{"op": "append", "content": "[\u26a0\ufe0f] [2026-01-05 02:55:37 UTC] [Agent: Orchestrator] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] CRITICAL FINDING: Agent E's BUG-001 analysis is INCORRECT. Proposed fix (remove entry_count check, use only file existence) would BREAK the tool permanently. Root cause: set_project CREATES PROGRESS_LOG.md via generate_doc_templates (line 667), so file.exists() is ALWAYS True after first call. CORRECT fix requires hash comparison: baseline_hash vs current_hash to detect template vs modified docs. Infrastructure exists (ProjectRegistry.record_doc_update) but generate_doc_templates doesn't call it. Wave 1 requires Review Agent evaluation before Wave 2 deployment. | agent=Agent E; entry_type=quality_gate_failure; issue=BUG-001_incorrect_analysis; phase=phase_1_wave_1_review; severity=critical; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-05T02:55:37.457370+00:00_d68e8ffd", "timestamp": "2026-01-05T02:55:37.457400+00:00"}
