{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-05 03:21:23 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-G-ListGetProjects] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] Hash retrieval architecture investigation begins. Target: get_project.py lines 28-40 (_compute_doc_status) - this is the CRITICAL function for BUG-001 fix. Function retrieves baseline_hashes and current_hashes from ProjectRegistry.meta.docs structure. This enables hash-based detection of \"pristine template\" vs \"modified project\" which is the correct fix for BUG-001. | bug_impact=BUG-001; file=get_project.py; lines=28-40; phase=hash_architecture_analysis; reasoning={\"how\": \"Trace data flow: ProjectRegistry.get_project() \\u2192 info.meta['docs'] \\u2192 baseline_hashes/current_hashes extraction\", \"what\": \"Function retrieves baseline_hashes (pristine template state) and current_hashes (post-modification state) from registry metadata structure\", \"why\": \"BUG-001 requires understanding how get_project exposes hash data from ProjectRegistry - this is the missing piece of the fix architecture\"}; target_function=_compute_doc_status; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-05T03:21:23.717682+00:00_48bbe791", "timestamp": "2026-01-05T03:21:23.717714+00:00"}
