{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-05 03:21:25 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-I-GenTemplates] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] manage_docs integration pattern analyzed. Line 1343 shows best-effort ProjectRegistry.record_doc_update() call with before_hash and after_hash from ChangeRecord. Key insight: baseline_hash is set ONLY if doc not in baseline_map (line 229). For templates, before_hash=None, after_hash=SHA256(rendered). This creates the baseline on first write. generate_doc_templates MUST follow this pattern. | hash_logic=baseline set only if doc not in baseline_map; pattern=best_effort_registry_update; reasoning={\"how\": \"For new templates: before_hash=None creates baseline, after_hash=SHA256(rendered) sets both baseline and current\", \"what\": \"manage_docs uses try/except best-effort pattern with before_hash/after_hash from ChangeRecord\", \"why\": \"Understand correct integration pattern from existing working code\"}; reference_file=tools/manage_docs.py; reference_line=1343; template_values={\"after_hash\": \"SHA256(rendered)\", \"before_hash\": null}; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-05T03:21:25.162691+00:00_2def958e", "timestamp": "2026-01-05T03:21:25.162724+00:00"}
