{"op": "append", "content": "[\u26a0\ufe0f] [2026-01-05 03:21:25 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-H-ReadRecent] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] CRITICAL DISCOVERY: Filter logic duplicated between read_recent and query_entries - exact same priority/category/min_confidence filters | bucket=filtering; confidence=0.95; duplication_type=filter_chain; lines_duplicated=~40 LOC; reasoning={\"how\": \"Comparing filter implementation across both tools - same parameter names, same metadata extraction, same filtering logic. Only difference: query_entries has 10 filters, read_recent has subset of 7 filters\", \"what\": \"EXACT duplication found: read_recent lines 512-519 (_normalise_filters) and lines 554-569 (_apply_line_filters) implement IDENTICAL logic to query_entries filter chain (lines 710-726 priority, category, confidence)\", \"why\": \"Identifying code duplication to enable [BUCKET:filtering] module extraction\"}; unification_potential=HIGH; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-05T03:21:25.573995+00:00_a267f2f5", "timestamp": "2026-01-05T03:21:25.574024+00:00"}
