{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-05 03:21:25 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-H-ReadRecent] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] Identified 'n parameter bug' root cause: n/limit are typed as Optional[Any] but treated as int in page_size calculation | bug_category=type_safety; confidence=0.9; fixed_by_healing=True; proper_fix=Type as Optional[int] and validate at entry point; reasoning={\"how\": \"Traced parameter flow: declaration \\u2192 healing \\u2192 usage. Found type mismatch between signature (Any) and usage (int cast)\", \"what\": \"Lines 157-158: n and limit typed as Optional[Any]. Line 279: int(n) attempted without validation. Healing system (lines 60-73) catches this but requires try/except. Type signature promises Any but implementation expects numeric.\", \"why\": \"Briefing mentioned 'n parameter type error' as known bug - need to document root cause and impact\"}; root_cause=Optional[Any] type allows non-numeric values to reach int() cast; severity=low; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-05T03:21:25.855307+00:00_f4976622", "timestamp": "2026-01-05T03:21:25.855335+00:00"}
