{"op": "append", "content": "[\u26a0\ufe0f] [2026-01-05 03:22:46 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-H-ReadRecent] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] Token bloat pattern identified: Structural (JSON overhead + pagination), Metadata (raw_line duplication 100%), Duplication (message appears in both message field and raw_line), Safety padding (limit_metadata always included) | bloat_categories={\"duplication\": \"message in both message and raw_line fields\", \"metadata\": \"100% (raw_line duplication)\", \"safety_padding\": \"limit_metadata, reminders, recent_projects\", \"structural\": \"15% (JSON + pagination)\"}; bucket=formatting; confidence=0.95; optimization_potential=Remove raw_line from structured output = 50% token reduction; reasoning={\"how\": \"Analyzed structured format responses across all samples, identified redundant data patterns\", \"what\": \"Four bloat categories identified: 1) STRUCTURAL: JSON syntax, pagination object, ok/count fields (~15% overhead), 2) METADATA: raw_line field duplicates entire entry (~100% duplication), 3) DUPLICATION: message text appears twice (message + raw_line), 4) SAFETY_PADDING: limit_metadata, reminders, recent_projects always included even when empty\", \"why\": \"Mandatory: categorize all token bloat sources per orchestration rules\"}; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-05T03:22:47.000619+00:00_62a926d1", "timestamp": "2026-01-05T03:22:47.000680+00:00"}
