{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-05 11:49:48 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-Phase2-Storage] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] Task 1 (Storage Abstraction) - base.py interface analyzed. Identified 17 abstract methods defining storage contracts: upsert_project, fetch_project, list_projects, delete_project (4 project ops), insert_entry, fetch_recent_entries, query_entries (3 entry ops), 4 paginated variants with default implementations, 2 optional recording methods (record_doc_change, record_agent_report_card), and 5 agent session methods (upsert_agent_session, heartbeat_session, end_session, get_agent_project, set_agent_project). Also defines ConflictError exception for optimistic concurrency control. | abstract_methods=17; file=storage/base.py; loc=286; optional_methods=6; reasoning={\"how\": \"Complete file read of base.py, identified all @abstractmethod decorators, analyzed method signatures and documented purposes\", \"what\": \"Cataloged all abstract methods, their signatures, purposes, and relationship structure (project ops, entry ops, pagination, recording, sessions)\", \"why\": \"Must understand storage abstraction contracts to evaluate backend implementations and identify gaps\"}; task=task_1_abstraction; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-05T11:49:48.284767+00:00_301d841f", "timestamp": "2026-01-05T11:49:48.284803+00:00"}
