{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-05 11:56:15 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-Phase2-Storage] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] Deliverable 2/7 COMPLETE - Created wiki/storage/sqlite_backend.md (comprehensive 650+ line documentation of SQLite backend). Cataloged all 23 tables with complete schema definitions, constraints, foreign keys, and indexes (27+ total). Documented 17 fully implemented abstract methods with line references. Identified duplicate table definition at line 1128. Created comparison table showing 198 total columns across 8 functional categories. Ready for PostgreSQL gap comparison. | deliverable=wiki_page_2; file=wiki/storage/sqlite_backend.md; indexes_documented=27; methods_documented=17; reasoning={\"how\": \"Systematic schema extraction from sqlite.py lines 650-1060, method implementation analysis, pattern identification\", \"what\": \"Documented all 23 tables, 198 columns, 27+ indexes, all method implementations, connection management, and metadata handling patterns\", \"why\": \"Complete SQLite schema documentation establishes baseline for PostgreSQL parity analysis\"}; tables_documented=23; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-05T11:56:15.071992+00:00_05070f11", "timestamp": "2026-01-05T11:56:15.072023+00:00"}
