{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-05 12:02:34 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-Phase2-Storage] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] Phase 2: Storage & State Audit COMPLETE - All 7 deliverables delivered successfully. Created 4 comprehensive wiki pages (base_interface.md, sqlite_backend.md, postgres_backend.md, models.md), 2 implementation specs (SPEC-PG-001 PostgreSQL parity 80-120hrs, SPEC-STORAGE-001 abstraction enforcement 24-40hrs), and 1 critical bug report (BUG-STORAGE-001 with 11 violation instances). Key findings: 23 SQLite tables vs 13 PostgreSQL tables (10 missing), 9 abstraction violations in project_registry.py breaking PostgreSQL compatibility, complete state management documentation (862 LOC across 2 components). All with \u226510 Scribe log entries with reasoning chains. Ready for Review Agent validation. | critical_findings=[\"postgresql_10_tables_missing\", \"abstraction_violations_11_instances\", \"delete_project_not_implemented\"]; deliverables={\"bug_reports\": 1, \"specs\": 2, \"wiki_pages\": 4}; phase=phase_2_complete; reasoning={\"how\": \"Sequential task execution with file-by-file analysis, schema comparison, violation detection, effort estimation, and deliverable creation\", \"what\": \"Delivered comprehensive documentation, actionable implementation specs, critical bug report with evidence and impact analysis\", \"why\": \"Phase 2 complete systematic storage layer audit provides foundation for architectural decisions on PostgreSQL strategy and abstraction enforcement\"}; scribe_entries=10; total_effort_estimated=104-160 hours; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-05T12:02:34.170262+00:00_971d900e", "timestamp": "2026-01-05T12:02:34.170302+00:00"}
