{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-05 12:34:49 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-Phase3-CircularDeps] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] Discovered primary circular dependency: tools \u2194 server with lazy import pattern. server.py imports 'from scribe_mcp import tools' at line 458 (after server setup), while 15 tool files import 'from scribe_mcp.server import app'. This is an intentional late-binding pattern to register tools after server initialization. | affected_tools=15; circularity=tools_server; confidence=0.95; pattern=late_binding; reasoning={\"how\": \"Manual inspection of import statements and their context. Import happens after server initialization is complete, making it a late-binding registration pattern rather than a true circular dependency problem.\", \"what\": \"server.py imports tools module at line 458 after server setup with noqa comment, suggesting intentional late binding. Tools import server.app to register themselves with MCP server instance.\", \"why\": \"Need to understand if this circular dependency is intentional design or should be refactored\"}; server_import_line=458; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-05T12:34:49.371864+00:00_e14fe5b9", "timestamp": "2026-01-05T12:34:49.371904+00:00"}
