{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-05 13:12:34 UTC] [Agent: Orchestrator] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] Strategic planning for Phase 4 expansion. User requires STRICT research mode (no code changes), 4-5 subagent team with coordination. Expanded scope beyond original plan: (1) dead code detection, (2) old fallbacks/legacy cleanup, (3) API documentation accuracy validation, (4) cross-check all Phase 1-3 audit findings, (5) code duplication. Original plan was single agent 6-8hrs. New scope requires 20-30hrs with specialist teams. Examining ALL 204 files for comprehensive cleanup analysis. | mode=strict_research; phase=phase_4_planning; scope_expansion=True; teams_proposed=5; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-05T13:12:34.311770+00:00_0b42b7f6", "timestamp": "2026-01-05T13:12:34.311798+00:00"}
