{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-05 13:24:33 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-Phase4-LegacyCode] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] Critical coordination files read - Phase 4 Team C scope confirmed: legacy patterns (try/except fallbacks, deprecated wrappers, TODO comments), Phase 3 sys.path patterns (70 occurrences), version compatibility shims. Boundary: NO dead code detection (Team A), NO duplication measurement (Team B), NO API validation (Team D) | confidence=0.95; files_read=[\"phase_4_coordination.md\", \"PHASE_PLAN.md\"]; phase=4; reasoning={\"how\": \"Read coordination file and Phase 4 section (lines 708-884) to establish strict boundaries\", \"what\": \"Team C owns: fallback patterns, deprecated code, TODO removal comments, Phase 3 sys.path hacks. Does NOT own: dead code, duplication similarity, API validation\", \"why\": \"Must understand scope boundaries to prevent overlap with 4 other teams operating in parallel\"}; stage=research; team=C; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-05T13:24:33.517049+00:00_0650ccc2", "timestamp": "2026-01-05T13:24:33.517080+00:00"}
