{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-05 13:24:40 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-Phase4-DeadCode] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] Team A (Dead Code Detective) Phase 4 research initialized - Scope confirmed: AST-based detection of unreferenced functions/classes/methods, orphaned utilities, import graph analysis, and coverage gap integration across all 204 Python files | confidence=0.95; coordination_file_read=True; phase=phase_4_dead_code; reasoning={\"how\": \"Multi-phase approach: (1) Build complete import graph with AST, (2) Cross-reference with grep usage verification, (3) Integrate pytest coverage data, (4) Categorize by removal safety level\", \"what\": \"Scope boundaries established: (1) AST import graph analysis, (2) unreferenced function detection, (3) coverage integration, (4) orphaned utility identification. Excludes: code similarity (Team B), API validation (Team D), legacy patterns (Team C)\", \"why\": \"Initiating Phase 4 Team A dead code detection to identify safe-to-remove unreferenced code and consolidation opportunities\"}; scope_confirmed=True; team=A; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-05T13:24:40.096503+00:00_7a933ccb", "timestamp": "2026-01-05T13:24:40.096533+00:00"}
