{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-05 13:24:45 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-Phase4-Duplication] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] Context established - coordination file and cross-cutting concerns reviewed. Confirmed scope boundaries: code similarity \u226580%, known duplications (DUPLICATION-002: doc gathering 3x, _count_log_entries 2x), consolidation strategy with module bucket mapping | confidence=0.95; phase=4; reasoning={\"how\": \"Read coordination file lines 1-200, phase plan lines 708-884, cross-cutting concerns lines 1-200. Verified my scope: similarity detection, consolidation design, LOC quantification. Will NOT find dead code (Team A), validate APIs (Team D), or audit legacy (Team C)\", \"what\": \"Coordination file defines: fuzzy matching \\u226580%, consolidation with [BUCKET:] tags, handoff rules to other teams. Cross-cutting concerns reveals 2 known duplications (270-300 LOC waste from doc gathering, 2x _count_log_entries)\", \"why\": \"Need to understand scope boundaries and known patterns before starting full codebase scan to avoid overlap with Teams A/C/D/E\"}; stage=research; team=B; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-05T13:24:45.662006+00:00_6ed8851c", "timestamp": "2026-01-05T13:24:45.662041+00:00"}
