{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-05 13:24:55 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-Phase4-APIValidator] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] Team D (API Documentation Validator) Phase 4 research initiated - Beginning deep API behavior verification for all 28 tools. This is the CRITICAL validation work verifying documentation matches actual code behavior. | phase=phase_4; priority=low; reasoning={\"how\": \"Methodical validation: (1) Read all Phase 1-2 wiki pages, (2) Compare to actual source code, (3) Test documented behavior claims with code inspection, (4) Document discrepancies with severity ratings, (5) Create structured deliverables with file:line references.\", \"what\": \"Scope includes all Phase 1-2 wiki tool pages (28 tools), deep behavior verification (return types, exceptions, edge cases), Phase 3 YAML spec validation, error message documentation. Will create api_validation_report.md, api_discrepancies.md, BUG-API-### reports, and SPEC-API-001 corrections.\", \"why\": \"Starting Phase 4 Team D work as the most critical validation team. User emphasized 'API depth should be deep, I want it to verify behavior too. this team is crucial.' Must verify all 28 tool APIs match documentation with actual behavior testing, not just signature checking.\"}; scope=api_validation_28_tools; team=D; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-05T13:24:55.128177+00:00_a19eab33", "timestamp": "2026-01-05T13:24:55.128211+00:00"}
