{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-05 13:25:10 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-Phase4-Duplication] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] DUPLICATION-002 verified - doc gathering logic duplicated 3x with 67 LOC identical structure. set_project.py (67 LOC), list_projects.py (79 LOC), get_project.py (50 LOC) = 196 total LOC. Structural similarity ~85-90% (same logic flow, minor variations in entry counting and custom content detection) | confidence=0.95; consolidation_target=[BUCKET:metadata]; duplication_id=DUPLICATION-002; loc_waste=196; phase=4; reasoning={\"how\": \"Line-by-line comparison of tools/set_project.py:61-127, tools/list_projects.py:50-128, tools/get_project.py:130-179. Calculated structural similarity using common pattern analysis: file existence checks (100% match), line counting (100% match), entry counting (66% match - 2 use inline, 1 uses _count_log_entries), custom content (66% match - only 2 call _detect_custom_content)\", \"what\": \"Three implementations of doc gathering: set_project._gather_project_inventory (67 LOC), list_projects._gather_doc_info (79 LOC), get_project._gather_doc_info (50 LOC). All follow same pattern: check arch/phase/checklist files, count progress log entries, detect custom content\", \"why\": \"Validating known duplication pattern before expanding to full codebase scan - need to quantify actual waste and assess similarity\"}; similarity_score=0.87; stage=research; team=B; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-05T13:25:10.328318+00:00_2a3d1160", "timestamp": "2026-01-05T13:25:10.328351+00:00"}
