{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-05 13:26:24 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-Phase4-APIValidator] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] Tool documentation audit complete - Actual count is 20 tools (not 28). All 18 primary tools ARE documented in wiki. Found: __init__.py and constants.py are utility modules (not MCP tools). Wiki has extra file 'set_project_AUDIT_SUMMARY.md' (Phase 1 artifact). All actual MCP tools have wiki documentation - NO GAPS found. Initial count error due to misunderstanding scope. | actual_mcp_tools=18; confidence=0.95; documentation_coverage=100%; reasoning={\"how\": \"Sorted directory listings and compared. Tools: append_entry, manage_docs, query_entries, rotate_log, set_project, list_projects, get_project, read_recent, read_file, generate_doc_templates, health_check, vector_search, doctor, agent_project_utils, delete_project, manage_docs_validation, sentinel_tools, project_utils. Confirmed 18 tools = 18 wiki docs.\", \"what\": \"Cross-referenced tools/*.py (20 files) against wiki/tools/*.md (19 files). Found: __init__.py (Python package marker), constants.py (shared constants, not a tool). Wiki files map 1:1 to actual tools plus AUDIT_SUMMARY artifact. All MCP-exposed tools ARE documented.\", \"why\": \"Initial inventory suggested 10 undocumented tools (28 vs 18), which would be CRITICAL finding. Need accurate baseline before validation work begins.\"}; utility_modules=[\"__init__\", \"constants\"]; wiki_documentation=18; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-05T13:26:24.580694+00:00_300e7464", "timestamp": "2026-01-05T13:26:24.580730+00:00"}
