{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-05 13:26:53 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-Phase4-APIValidator] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] Starting deep validation of append_entry.py - Comparing wiki documentation (lines 1-400 analyzed) against actual source code (lines 1-200 analyzed). Wiki claims: 21 parameters, 2,357 LOC, 3 execution modes (sentinel/bulk/single), 7 global singletons. Verifying actual implementation matches. | reasoning={\"how\": \"Read wiki documentation sections 2.1-2.12, read actual source code lines 1-200 and signature block. Will verify: (1) parameter count/types, (2) LOC accuracy, (3) singleton initialization, (4) execution mode routing, (5) error handling behaviors, (6) return type claims.\", \"what\": \"Wiki claims: 21-param signature, 2357 LOC, sentinel/bulk/single modes, 7 singletons (_CONFIG_MANAGER, _BULK_CALCULATOR, _PARALLEL_PROCESSOR, _PARAMETER_CORRECTOR, _EXCEPTION_HEALER, _FALLBACK_MANAGER, _PROJECT_REGISTRY). Comparing against actual lines 1-200 and function signature at line 1232.\", \"why\": \"Beginning systematic API validation with append_entry (monster tool #1). Must verify documented parameters, LOC count, execution modes, and behaviors match actual code implementation.\"}; source_lines_analyzed=1-200,1232-1290; tool=append_entry; validation_stage=signature_and_structure; wiki_sections_read=2.1-2.12; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-05T13:26:53.814253+00:00_5c3705b9", "timestamp": "2026-01-05T13:26:53.814289+00:00"}
