{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-05 13:27:12 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-Phase4-DeadCode] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] Analyzing dead code patterns from AST scan results - identifying high-frequency false positives (annotations imports, __init__ exports) and categorizing findings by removal safety | confidence=0.8; phase=phase_4_dead_code; reasoning={\"how\": \"Statistical analysis of JSON results to identify recurring patterns, then grep verification of suspicious findings to confirm actual dead code vs false positives\", \"what\": \"Analyzing 435 unused imports and 1030 unreferenced definitions for patterns: (1) annotations imports (PEP 563), (2) __init__ re-exports, (3) private helper methods, (4) test fixtures, (5) plugin registry functions\", \"why\": \"Raw AST findings contain many false positives (PEP 563 annotations, __init__ re-exports, private helper functions) - need pattern analysis to separate true dead code from intentional patterns\"}; step=pattern_analysis; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-05T13:27:12.208803+00:00_2ab2cbbd", "timestamp": "2026-01-05T13:27:12.208833+00:00"}
