{"op": "append", "content": "[\u26a0\ufe0f] [2026-01-05 13:27:15 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-Phase4-APIValidator] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] VALIDATION FINDING: append_entry.py signature MATCHES wiki documentation with ONE DISCREPANCY. Wiki claims 21 parameters, actual function has 19 named parameters + **_kwargs (line 1252). Counting: message, status, emoji, agent, meta, timestamp_utc, items, items_list, auto_split, split_delimiter, stagger_seconds, agent_id, log_type, priority, category, tags, confidence, config, format = 19 params. Wiki may have counted **_kwargs or included deprecated parameters. | actual_count=19_named_plus_kwargs; finding_type=parameter_count_mismatch; impact=documentation_accuracy; reasoning={\"how\": \"Manual parameter count from actual signature: message(1), status(2), emoji(3), agent(4), meta(5), timestamp_utc(6), items(7), items_list(8), auto_split(9), split_delimiter(10), stagger_seconds(11), agent_id(12), log_type(13), priority(14), category(15), tags(16), confidence(17), config(18), format(19), **_kwargs(varies). Total = 19 named + kwargs.\", \"what\": \"Wiki section 2.8 line 1232 claims '21-parameter signature + **_kwargs'. Actual code lines 1232-1252 shows 19 named parameters + **_kwargs. Discrepancy = 2 parameters. Need to identify if wiki counted **_kwargs as 2 params or if deprecated params were removed.\", \"why\": \"Critical parameter count validation - documentation accuracy affects developer usage and API contracts.\"}; severity=MEDIUM; tool=append_entry; wiki_claim=21_parameters; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-05T13:27:15.161067+00:00_ce45d7cb", "timestamp": "2026-01-05T13:27:15.161101+00:00"}
