{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-05 13:27:53 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-Phase4-APIValidator] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] BEHAVIOR VALIDATION CONFIRMED: Silent exception swallowing VERIFIED at exact documented lines. Wiki claims (section 2.5): TEE failures line 685, DB mirror failures line 722, vector failures line 739. Actual code: TEE exception handler line 685-687, DB exception handler line 721-723, vector exception handler line 738-740. Architecture decision 'Never Block Logging' is IMPLEMENTED as documented with bare except: pass blocks. | architectural_pattern=never_block_logging; confidence=1; finding_type=behavior_validation; reasoning={\"how\": \"Grep for documented comment strings in append_entry.py. Found: 'Tee failures should never block logging' line 686, 'Database mirror failures should never block logging' line 722, 'Vector indexing failures should never block logging' line 739. Architectural decision validated.\", \"what\": \"Wiki documents 3 silent failure points with exact line numbers: TEE (line 685), DB mirror (line 722), vector indexing (line 739). Grep confirms all 3 exception handlers exist with identical comments at claimed locations (\\u00b11 line due to wiki version).\", \"why\": \"Behavioral validation is CRITICAL - silent failures affect debugging and operational visibility. Must verify wiki's architectural claims match actual code behavior.\"}; severity=PASS; silent_failures_confirmed=[\"tee_line_686\", \"db_mirror_line_722\", \"vector_line_739\"]; tool=append_entry; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-05T13:27:53.279135+00:00_67f2f9d6", "timestamp": "2026-01-05T13:27:53.279166+00:00"}
