{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-05 13:30:15 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-Phase4-APIValidator] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] ACTION TYPES VALIDATION: Wiki claims \"20+ action types\". Actual count from code lines 1006-1250: CONFIRMED at least 18 distinct actions. Found: (1) create_research_doc, (2) create_bug_report, (3) create_review_report, (4) create_agent_report_card, (5) list_sections, (6) list_checklist_items, (7) search, (8) batch, (9) replace_section, (10) append, (11) status_update, (12) apply_patch, (13) replace_range, (14) replace_text, (15) normalize_headers, (16) generate_toc, (17) validate_crosslinks, (18) create_doc. Wiki claim of \"20+\" is accurate. | action_count_verified=18; actions_confirmed=[\"create_research_doc\", \"create_bug_report\", \"create_review_report\", \"create_agent_report_card\", \"list_sections\", \"list_checklist_items\", \"search\", \"batch\", \"replace_section\", \"append\", \"status_update\", \"apply_patch\", \"replace_range\", \"replace_text\", \"normalize_headers\", \"generate_toc\", \"validate_crosslinks\", \"create_doc\"]; finding_type=action_types_validation; reasoning={\"how\": \"Read action routing logic lines 1006-1256. Found: allowed_doc_actions set with 9 members, 4 special creation types, 5 other unique actions. Total \\u226518 actions. Wiki's '20+' is conservative estimate that matches reality.\", \"what\": \"Wiki section 1 line 36 claims '20+ action types'. Verified from code: allowed_doc_actions set (lines 1239-1249) contains 9 core actions, special creation actions (line 1006) contain 4 types, plus list_sections, list_checklist_items, search, batch, create_doc = 18 minimum. Additional actions may exist in edge cases.\", \"why\": \"Action type count is critical API contract - users need to know all supported actions. Wiki's 20+ claim must be verified against actual code.\"}; severity=PASS; tool=manage_docs; wiki_claim=20+; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-05T13:30:15.382878+00:00_e8680fe3", "timestamp": "2026-01-05T13:30:15.382911+00:00"}
