{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-05 13:30:37 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-Phase4-Duplication] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] Codebase scan complete - identified 4 major duplication patterns. Creating comprehensive catalog: DUPLICATION-001 (_count_log_entries 2x, 23 LOC waste), DUPLICATION-002 (doc gathering 3x, 196 LOC waste), DUPLICATION-003 (config classes 3x, 1674 LOC with 95% similarity), DUPLICATION-004 (formatter coupling 11 call sites). Total LOC waste quantified: 219 direct duplication + 1674 config infrastructure duplication = 1893 LOC | confidence=0.93; config_duplication=1674; direct_duplication=219; patterns_found=4; phase=4; reasoning={\"how\": \"Systematic scan of tools/ (28 files), utils/ (25 files), storage/ (5 files) directories. Used grep for pattern matching, file size analysis for hotspots, line-by-line comparison for similarity scoring. Cross-referenced with Phase 1-3 findings from cross_cutting_concerns.md\", \"what\": \"Four duplication patterns identified: (1) _count_log_entries 2x implementations with different logic, (2) doc gathering logic 3x with 85-90% similarity, (3) config classes 3x with 95% shared infrastructure, (4) private formatter method coupling 11 call sites. Total waste: 1893 LOC\", \"why\": \"Comprehensive catalog provides complete picture of all code duplication for consolidation planning - need to document findings before creating implementation specs\"}; stage=research; team=B; total_loc_waste=1893; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-05T13:30:37.966677+00:00_0d38117a", "timestamp": "2026-01-05T13:30:37.966709+00:00"}
