{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-05 14:55:29 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-Phase5-FormatValidator] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] Team A1 report analyzed - discovered 2 systemic bugs (BUG-FORMAT-003 compact mode broken 100%, BUG-FORMAT-004 rotate_log no readable). 8/16 tools tested. Readable mode achieves 52% avg token reduction | action=team_a1_analysis; confidence=0.98; critical_bugs=[\"BUG-FORMAT-003: compact mode returns identical JSON to structured\", \"BUG-FORMAT-004: rotate_log has no readable mode\"]; key_metrics={\"compact_broken\": \"100%\", \"readable_reduction_avg\": \"52%\", \"tools_tested\": 8}; phase=5_format_validation; reasoning={\"how\": \"Read Team A1 final report, extracted bug findings, token reduction metrics, identified get_project anomaly (readable 4x larger than JSON)\", \"what\": \"Constraints: 8 tools tested with full mode coverage, 2 systemic bugs affecting all tools. Alternatives: compact mode completely non-functional (not optimization issue, implementation issue). Coverage: proven readable mode highly effective, compact mode needs ground-up implementation\", \"why\": \"Understand systemic format parameter failures to inform validation audit and implementation specs\"}; stage=research; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-05T14:55:29.599388+00:00_c4650bf2", "timestamp": "2026-01-05T14:55:29.599421+00:00"}
