{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-05 14:56:15 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-Phase5-TokenAnalyzer] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] Initial token measurement complete - analyzed 16 tools totaling 1,687 tokens across available recordings. Created automated analysis script using tiktoken cl100k_base encoding. Generated preliminary token_measurement_report.md and token_measurements.json. Next: detailed bloat categorization for each tool. | action=initial_measurement; deliverables=[\"token_measurement_report.md\", \"token_measurements.json\", \"token_analyzer.py\"]; phase=5; reasoning={\"how\": \"Created Python script with tiktoken cl100k_base encoder, processed all .txt files in tool_outputs\", \"what\": \"Measured all available tool outputs using tiktoken\", \"why\": \"Baseline token measurements required before bloat analysis\"}; team=C; tools_measured=16; total_tokens=1687; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-05T14:56:15.618856+00:00_d297c64b", "timestamp": "2026-01-05T14:56:15.618890+00:00"}
