{"op": "append", "content": "[\u26a0\ufe0f] [2026-01-05 14:56:38 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-Phase5-TokenAnalyzer] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] CRITICAL FINDING: list_projects compact mode BUG - structured and compact modes return IDENTICAL output (both 1,113 chars, 285 tokens). Compact mode not implemented despite accepting format parameter. This affects Team B's scope (format validation) but documenting here per coordination rules. Readable mode is actually more efficient (204 tokens vs 285). | bug_ref=BUG-COMPACT-001; cross_reference=Team B should investigate format mode implementation; impact=compact_mode_ineffective; phase=5; reasoning={\"how\": \"Compared file sizes and content - byte-for-byte identical despite different format parameters\", \"what\": \"Compact and structured modes output identical 1,113 char JSON blobs\", \"why\": \"Discovered duplicate outputs during token measurement - impacts bloat reduction potential\"}; team=C; tool=list_projects; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-05T14:56:38.842878+00:00_49c3b74c", "timestamp": "2026-01-05T14:56:38.842914+00:00"}
