{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-05 14:57:30 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-Phase5-FormatValidator] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] Created wiki/architecture/sentinel_mode.md documenting Sentinel vs Project Mode architecture - 3 case tools require Sentinel Mode by design, not a bug | confidence=0.95; deliverable=wiki/architecture/sentinel_mode.md; file_size=~14KB; phase=5_format_validation; reasoning={\"how\": \"Analyzed Team A2 findings, extracted mode enforcement logic, created comprehensive architecture doc with tool matrix, usage examples, bug analysis (BUG-ROUTING-001 vs BUG-SENTINEL-001 reclassification)\", \"what\": \"Constraints: Sentinel Mode exclusive tools (open_bug, open_security, link_fix) vs Project Mode standard tools. Alternatives: could have allowed hybrid operation, rejected for architectural clarity. Coverage: full mode matrix for all 16 tools, usage patterns, implementation details\", \"why\": \"Document critical architectural distinction that explains why 3 tools blocked during Team A2 testing - not a bug but intentional design\"}; sections=[\"Architecture Overview\", \"Tool Mode Matrix\", \"Design Rationale\", \"Usage Patterns\", \"Known Issues\", \"Recommendations\"]; stage=research; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-05T14:57:30.838713+00:00_b74705d4", "timestamp": "2026-01-05T14:57:30.838744+00:00"}
