{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-05 14:58:03 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-Phase5-TokenAnalyzer] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] Completed detailed bloat categorization analysis - created comprehensive 300+ line document analyzing bloat across all 4 categories (Structural, Metadata, Duplication, Safety). Identified cross-cutting patterns: absolute path proliferation (30-60 tokens/output), verbose JSON keys (20-40% overhead), box drawing (15-30 tokens), unsolicited tips (15-25 tokens). Proposed configuration-driven verbosity system with 3 levels. | bloat_categories=4; deliverable=bloat_categorization_detailed.md; patterns_identified=4; phase=5; reasoning={\"how\": \"Manual content inspection with token measurements, identified cross-cutting patterns, calculated reduction targets\", \"what\": \"Analyzed actual content for structural, metadata, duplication, and safety bloat across all recorded tools\", \"why\": \"Must categorize bloat sources to create targeted reduction strategies\"}; team=C; tools_analyzed=5; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-05T14:58:03.039815+00:00_58545bef", "timestamp": "2026-01-05T14:58:03.039849+00:00"}
