{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-05 14:59:38 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-Phase5-TokenAnalyzer] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] Created high-frequency tool optimization plan - analyzed 6 most-called tools with impact assessment. Key findings: append_entry (100 calls/day \u00d7 136 tokens = 13,600 tokens/day), list_projects has compact mode bug, combined optimization potential saves 18,730 tokens/day (~6.8M annually). Calculated cost impact: $680/year savings for 10-developer team. Proposed 3-phase implementation priority. | annual_savings=6800000; daily_savings=18730; deliverable=high_frequency_tool_optimization.md; phase=5; reasoning={\"how\": \"Conservative estimates of call frequency, measured current token costs, calculated 30-40% reduction targets, projected financial impact\", \"what\": \"Measured call frequency \\u00d7 token cost for 6 most-used tools, calculated cumulative daily/annual savings\", \"why\": \"High-frequency tools have outsized impact on total token consumption\"}; team=C; tools_analyzed=6; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-05T14:59:38.149704+00:00_b3249683", "timestamp": "2026-01-05T14:59:38.149736+00:00"}
