{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-05 15:21:53 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-ManageDocsAudit] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] SUCCESS: create_bug_report action WORKS! Created bug report at docs/bugs/infrastructure/2026-01-05_manage_docs_missing_docs_field/report.md (1993 bytes). This is the FIRST SUCCESSFUL manage_docs action test. Bug report documents the critical docs field missing from database project resolution. Action parameters: doc='bug_report', metadata with category/slug/severity/title/component fields. | file_created=docs/bugs/infrastructure/2026-01-05_manage_docs_missing_docs_field/report.md; file_size=1993; parameters_used={\"action\": \"create_bug_report\", \"doc\": \"bug_report\", \"metadata_fields\": [\"category\", \"slug\", \"severity\", \"title\", \"component\"]}; phase=5.5_manage_docs_audit; reasoning={\"how\": \"Called manage_docs with action=create_bug_report, provided required metadata fields, received success response with path\", \"what\": \"Constraints: metadata requires category and slug. Optional fields: severity, title, component. Created in docs/bugs/<category>/<date>_<slug>/ structure\", \"why\": \"Verify create_bug_report works and document the critical bug discovered\"}; stage=research; test_action=create_bug_report; test_result=PASS; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-05T15:21:53.589355+00:00_602f79cc", "timestamp": "2026-01-05T15:21:53.589388+00:00"}
