{"op": "append", "content": "[\u26a0\ufe0f] [2026-01-05 15:22:17 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-ManageDocsAudit] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] Phase 5.5 manage_docs audit STATUS UPDATE: Tested 2/17 actions so far. RESULTS: (1) create_bug_report: PASS - successfully creates bug reports in docs/bugs/<category>/<date>_<slug>/ structure. (2) list_sections: BLOCKED by critical infrastructure bug - database project resolution missing 'docs' field. ROOT CAUSE IDENTIFIED: shared/logging_utils.py:111-119 database query only selects 3 fields, state.json has full mapping but db-first path loses it. IMPACT: Likely affects 14+ document editing actions. NEXT: Test create_research_doc (might work like create_bug_report), then investigate state.json fallback workaround vs fixing root cause. | actions_tested=2; actions_total=17; blocked_actions=[\"list_sections\"]; blocked_count=1; bug_location=shared/logging_utils.py:111-119; critical_bug_found=True; likely_blocked=14; pass_count=1; phase=5.5_manage_docs_audit; reasoning={\"how\": \"Tested create_bug_report (success), list_sections (blocked by missing docs field), analyzed root cause in database resolution path\", \"what\": \"Constraints: 2 actions tested, 1 critical bug blocks most actions. Alternatives: continue testing vs fix bug first vs find workaround. Chose continue testing to identify working vs broken actions\", \"why\": \"Must track progress and identify testing strategy given critical blocker\"}; stage=research; working_actions=[\"create_bug_report\"]; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-05T15:22:17.885228+00:00_36b8673a", "timestamp": "2026-01-05T15:22:17.885263+00:00"}
