{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-05 15:22:38 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-ManageDocsAudit] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] SUCCESS: create_research_doc action WORKS! Created research document at docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/research/RESEARCH_MANAGE_DOCS_AUDIT_20260105.md (2045 bytes). ACTION PATTERN IDENTIFIED: Document creation actions (create_bug_report, create_research_doc) that generate new files with auto-determined paths work correctly - they don't require 'docs' field in project context. Document editing actions that operate on registered docs (list_sections, replace_section, etc) are blocked by missing docs field bug. Testing progress: 3/17 actions, 2 PASS, 1 BLOCKED. | actions_tested=3; blocked_actions=[\"list_sections\"]; file_created=docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/research/RESEARCH_MANAGE_DOCS_AUDIT_20260105.md; file_size=2045; pattern_identified=creation_actions_work_editing_actions_blocked; phase=5.5_manage_docs_audit; reasoning={\"how\": \"Tested create_research_doc with doc_name and metadata, received success, identified that file creation actions bypass the docs field requirement\", \"what\": \"Constraints: Creation actions don't need docs field, editing actions do. Pattern: auto-path creation works, registered doc operations fail. Alternative testing: could test all actions vs categorize first - chose categorize for efficiency\", \"why\": \"Identify which action categories work vs broken to optimize testing strategy\"}; stage=research; test_action=create_research_doc; test_result=PASS; working_actions=[\"create_bug_report\", \"create_research_doc\"]; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-05T15:22:38.249316+00:00_59f0a323", "timestamp": "2026-01-05T15:22:38.249348+00:00"}
