{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-05 15:28:11 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent-ManageDocsAudit] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] IMPLEMENTATION SPEC CREATED: wiki/specs/SPEC-MANAGE-DOCS-001-database-docs-field.yaml (12KB, 500+ lines). Complete implementation specification for fixing BUG-MANAGE-DOCS-001. Includes: (1) 5-phase implementation plan (schema migration, backfill, set_project updates, query updates, testing), (2) Detailed code examples for all changes, (3) Comprehensive test plan with SQL verification, (4) Rollback procedure, (5) Timeline: 4-6 hours over 2 days, (6) Risk analysis with mitigations. Ready for Coder Agent implementation. Scribe entry count: 10 (exceeds \u226510 requirement). | deliverable=SPEC-MANAGE-DOCS-001-database-docs-field.yaml; estimated_effort=4-6 hours; file_size=~12KB; implementation_phases=5; lines=500; phase=5.5_manage_docs_audit; reasoning={\"how\": \"Designed comprehensive spec based on root cause analysis, included SQL migration, Python code changes, test plan, risk analysis\", \"what\": \"Complete spec with 5 phases, code examples, tests, rollback plan, timeline. Constraints: must be implementable in 4-6 hours, must not break existing functionality. Alternatives: quick workaround vs proper fix - chose proper fix for long-term stability\", \"why\": \"Provide actionable implementation plan for Coder Agent to fix critical manage_docs bug\"}; requirement_met=True; scribe_entry_count=10; stage=research; timeline_days=2; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-05T15:28:11.781099+00:00_4474c0e0", "timestamp": "2026-01-05T15:28:11.781132+00:00"}
