{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-07 22:01:30 UTC] [Agent: CoderAgent-SchemaFix] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] Root cause confirmed: _tool_decorator uses empty schema {\"properties\": {}} instead of introspecting function signatures. All parameters work in Python but MCP clients don't know they exist. Solution: Update _tool_decorator to use inspect.signature() to build proper MCP schemas from Python type hints. | approach=add signature introspection to _tool_decorator; files_to_modify=[\"server.py\"]; solution=introspect_function_signatures; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-07T22:01:30.571532+00:00_249640d3", "timestamp": "2026-01-07T22:01:30.571563+00:00"}
