{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-08 01:10:30 UTC] [Agent: Scribe Coder] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] Starting SPEC-GEN-001 implementation: Adding baseline hash recording to generate_doc_templates.py. Will add imports (hashlib, ProjectRegistry), module-level registry instance, and hash recording after template write at line 222. | changes=[\"add_imports\", \"add_registry_instance\", \"add_hash_recording\"]; file=tools/generate_doc_templates.py; reasoning={\"how\": \"Adding imports after line 8, module-level registry after line 39, and hash recording in try-except after line 222 where templates are written. Using best-effort pattern to prevent template generation failures.\", \"what\": \"Need to integrate ProjectRegistry to record baseline hashes when templates are created. Alternatives: could do this in set_project but that's too late - need to record at creation time. Must be best-effort to not break template generation.\", \"why\": \"generate_doc_templates creates templates but doesn't record baseline hashes, preventing set_project from detecting pristine vs modified docs\"}; spec=SPEC-GEN-001; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-08T01:10:30.879915+00:00_bb420eff", "timestamp": "2026-01-08T01:10:30.879945+00:00"}
