{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-08 01:15:15 UTC] [Agent: Scribe Coder] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] SPEC-GEN-001 implementation complete and verified. All changes integrated into generate_doc_templates.py: baseline hash recording added with ProjectRegistry integration. All 5 generate_doc tests passing including 2 new SPEC-GEN-001 tests. Implementation ready for production use. | changes_summary=Added hashlib and ProjectRegistry imports, module-level registry instance, and best-effort hash recording after template write. Hashes stored in scribe_projects.meta JSON as baseline_hashes and current_hashes.; confidence=0.95; files_created=[\"tests/test_gen_001_baseline_hash_recorded.py\"]; files_modified=[\"tools/generate_doc_templates.py\"]; reasoning={\"how\": \"Modified generate_doc_templates.py at 3 insertion points as specified. Created 2 comprehensive tests verifying hash recording in meta JSON and graceful degradation. Ran full test suite to verify no regressions (5/5 tests passing).\", \"what\": \"Implementation includes: imports, registry instance, hash recording with try-except safety, comprehensive tests verifying hash storage and best-effort pattern. All existing tests pass, no regressions introduced.\", \"why\": \"SPEC-GEN-001 complete - generate_doc_templates now records baseline hashes enabling set_project to detect pristine vs modified docs\"}; spec=SPEC-GEN-001; tests_passing=5; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-08T01:15:15.760831+00:00_25df99e1", "timestamp": "2026-01-08T01:15:15.760864+00:00"}
