{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-08 01:15:29 UTC] [Agent: Scribe Coder] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] DELIVERABLE COMPLETE: SPEC-GEN-001 baseline hash recording successfully integrated into generate_doc_templates.py. Registry integration enables set_project to detect pristine vs modified docs through baseline/current hash comparison. Code changes: (1) imports added at lines 10-13, (2) module-level registry at line 42, (3) hash recording at lines 227-238 with best-effort exception handling. Test coverage: 2 new tests verify hash storage in scribe_projects.meta JSON and graceful degradation on registry failures. All 5 generate_doc tests passing with zero regressions. | confidence=0.95; deliverable=complete; hash_storage_mechanism=scribe_projects.meta JSON with baseline_hashes and current_hashes maps; implementation_report={\"files_created\": 1, \"files_modified\": 1, \"lines_added\": 17, \"regressions\": 0, \"tests_created\": 2, \"tests_passing\": 5}; integration_points=[\"generate_doc_templates line 227-238\", \"ProjectRegistry.record_doc_update\", \"scribe_projects.meta.docs.baseline_hashes\", \"scribe_projects.meta.docs.current_hashes\"]; reasoning={\"how\": \"Made 3 precise code insertions as specified: imports after line 8, registry instance after line 39, hash recording after template write at line 222. Used best-effort try-except to prevent template generation failures. Created 2 tests: one verifying hash storage in meta JSON with pristine flags, one verifying graceful degradation. Ran full test suite confirming zero regressions across all 5 generate_doc tests.\", \"what\": \"Integrated ProjectRegistry into generate_doc_templates with best-effort hash recording after each template write. Hashes stored in meta JSON blob enable pristine detection (baseline == current) and modified detection (baseline != current). Added comprehensive tests for both happy path and failure scenarios.\", \"why\": \"Complete SPEC-GEN-001 implementation enables doc lifecycle tracking by recording baseline hashes at template creation time, solving the pristine vs modified detection problem for set_project\"}; spec=SPEC-GEN-001; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-08T01:15:29.760583+00:00_568dd25a", "timestamp": "2026-01-08T01:15:29.760672+00:00"}
