{"op": "append", "content": "[\u26a0\ufe0f] [2026-01-08 01:16:02 UTC] [Agent: Scribe Coder] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] Test progress - 9/10 tests passing. Issue: extract_result() not extracting recent_entries from MCP wrapper for verbose=True test. Need to handle structuredContent properly. | failing_test=test_get_project_verbose_true_includes_entries; issue=extract_result returns readable_content for readable format but doesn't include recent_entries field; reasoning={\"how\": \"Need to merge both content.text and structuredContent to get complete data\", \"what\": \"Readable format returns TextContent, but we need to also check structuredContent for additional fields\", \"why\": \"MCP wraps responses differently for readable vs structured formats\"}; test_results=9 passed, 1 failed; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-08T01:16:02.214044+00:00_a652f75c", "timestamp": "2026-01-08T01:16:02.214072+00:00"}
