{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-08 01:21:04 UTC] [Agent: Scribe Coder] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] SPEC-SET-001 COMPLETE \u2713 Both tests passing! Bug fixed: Empty logs after rotation now correctly show EXISTING project SITREP. Genuinely new projects still show NEW SITREP. Solution: Use doc_result['files'] to detect if docs were just generated (NEW) vs already existed (EXISTING). | value={\"spec\": \"SPEC-SET-001\", \"tests_passing\": 2, \"files_modified\": [\"shared/project_utils.py\", \"tools/set_project.py\", \"tests/test_set_project.py\"], \"deliverable_complete\": true, \"reasoning\": {\"why\": \"Fix bug where rotated empty logs were treated as NEW projects\", \"what\": \"Changed detection logic from entry_count==0 to docs_were_generated flag\", \"how\": \"Pass len(doc_result['files']) \\\\> 0 to detect_project_state to distinguish first-time creation from subsequent access\"}}}; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-08T01:21:04.836307+00:00_78c4a457", "timestamp": "2026-01-08T01:21:04.836340+00:00"}
{"op": "commit", "ref_id": "2026-01-08T01:21:04.836307+00:00_78c4a457", "timestamp": "2026-01-08T01:21:04.846425+00:00"}
{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-08 01:21:25 UTC] [Agent: Scribe Coder] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] SPEC-SET-001 Implementation Summary:  **Bug Fixed**: Empty progress logs (after rotation) were incorrectly treated as NEW projects instead of EXISTING projects.  **Root Cause**: Original code used `entry_count == 0` to determine if a project was new, which couldn't distinguish between: - Genuinely NEW project (first time created) - EXISTING project with rotated/empty log  **Solution Implemented**: - Modified `shared/project_utils.py::detect_project_state()` to accept `docs_were_generated` parameter - Changed detection logic: If docs were just created in THIS call \u2192 NEW, otherwise \u2192 EXISTING_LEGACY - Updated `tools/set_project.py` to pass flag: `docs_were_generated = len(doc_result.get(\"files\", [])) > 0`  **Tests Created**:  - `test_bug_001_empty_log_shows_existing_sitrep`: Verifies rotated logs show EXISTING SITREP \u2713 - `test_bug_001_genuinely_new_project`: Ensures truly new projects still work \u2713  **Files Modified**: 1. shared/project_utils.py (lines 11-97): Added docs_were_generated... | value={\"implementation_time_minutes\": 30, \"spec\": \"SPEC-SET-001\", \"confidence\": 0.95, \"tests_passing\": 2, \"tests_created\": 2, \"lines_changed\": 25, \"reasoning\": {\"why\": \"Provide complete implementation summary for audit trail\", \"what\": \"Document all changes, rationale, and verification steps\", \"how\": \"Comprehensive summary with technical details and test results\"}}}; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-08T01:21:25.085152+00:00_5a244364", "timestamp": "2026-01-08T01:21:25.085185+00:00"}
{"op": "commit", "ref_id": "2026-01-08T01:21:25.085152+00:00_5a244364", "timestamp": "2026-01-08T01:21:25.096133+00:00"}
