{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2705] [2026-01-08 01:24:35 UTC] [Agent: ReviewAgent-Stage5-Audit1] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] DEAD CODE CLEANUP VERIFICATION: Reviewed git diff for all modified files. NO dead code was removed - only additions made. SPEC-SET-001: Added 2 parameters to detect_project_state(), modified logic from entry_count==0 to docs_were_generated check. SPEC-FORMAT-002: Added _format_readable() function (76 lines), added verbose parameter. SPEC-GEN-001: Added imports and hash recording block. All changes are ADDITIVE or PARAMETER MODIFICATIONS - zero lines of working code deleted. User's concern about unsupervised cleanup is UNFOUNDED for this implementation. | changes_type=additive_only; deletions_found=0; files_reviewed=[\"shared/project_utils.py\", \"tools/set_project.py\", \"tools/rotate_log.py\", \"tools/get_project.py\", \"tools/generate_doc_templates.py\"]; reasoning={\"how\": \"Analyzed git diff output line by line, counted additions vs deletions, verified all changes are new functionality or parameter extensions\", \"what\": \"Git diff shows only additions and parameter modifications - no code deletion detected across all 5 modified files\", \"why\": \"User explicitly warned about unsupervised dead code cleanup - must verify agents didn't delete working code inappropriately\"}; verification_type=dead_code_analysis; priority=medium; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-08T01:24:35.317519+00:00_87b3770c", "timestamp": "2026-01-08T01:24:35.317550+00:00"}
