{"op": "append", "content": "[\u2139\ufe0f] [2026-01-08 04:56:32 UTC] [Agent: ResearchAgent] [Project: scribe_systematic_audit_1] DETAILED USAGE PATTERNS IDENTIFIED:  EDIT ACTIONS (replace_section, apply_patch, etc): - Uses doc_category as dictionary key for project[\"docs\"] registration - Auto-registration happens if doc_category not in project[\"docs\"] - Custom doc resolution uses doc_category to pick directory + doc_name to pick file  CREATE ACTIONS (create_research_doc, create_bug_report, etc): - Action name implies category (implicit) - doc_name required for filename - doc_category NOT passed to creation handler (implicit in action type)  AUTO-REGISTRATION: - _auto_register_document(project, doc_category) called from line 1305 - Resolves path via _resolve_doc_path(project, doc_category) - Stores in project[\"docs\"][doc_category] = path - Path resolution maps: \"architecture\" \u2192 \"ARCHITECTURE_GUIDE.md\" | auto_reg=maps_doc_category_to_path; confidence=1; create_actions=implicit_category; edit_actions=use_doc_category_as_key; finding_id=usage_patterns; priority=low; log_type=progress; content_type=log\n", "file_path": "/home/austin/projects/MCP_SPINE/scribe_mcp/.scribe/docs/dev_plans/scribe_systematic_audit_1/PROGRESS_LOG.md", "id": "2026-01-08T04:56:32.614765+00:00_d0b523a8", "timestamp": "2026-01-08T04:56:32.614798+00:00"}
